  "title": "最高人民法院关于人民法院对注册商标权进行财产保全的解释",
  "category": "司法解释",
  "issuingAuthority": "最高人民法院",
  "promulgationDate": "2020-12-29",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
  "status": "effective",
  "source": {
    "metadataPath": "data/laws/sfjs-e7e323671e/metadata.json",
